WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.291
There is a term going around called the

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:04.373
"Three Nothings": no mortgage, no car

00:00:04.373 --> 00:00:07.149
loan, and no offspring. Some say the

00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:09.798
reason is that the external environment

00:00:09.798 --> 00:00:12.447
is just too harsh—so harsh that young

00:00:12.447 --> 00:00:15.097
people can't even imagine settling down

00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:20.185
or pursuing a career. They might just

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:22.873
choose to "lie flat," not even thinking

00:00:22.873 --> 00:00:25.495
about marriage or dating, just getting

00:00:25.495 --> 00:00:28.173
by day to day and relaxing. But for the

00:00:28.173 --> 00:00:29.871
individual, I don’t think there is

00:00:29.871 --> 00:00:31.776
anything wrong with that. Young people

00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:33.748
have their own ideas and values, after

00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:35.402
all. However, if many young people

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:36.890
think this way, at your level as

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.647
President, don’t you think this is a

00:00:38.647 --> 00:00:40.407
problem? What would you like to say to

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:41.330
these young people?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:44.594
>> Yes, this is indeed a problem. If the

00:00:44.594 --> 00:00:47.064
social atmosphere reaches this point,

00:00:47.064 --> 00:00:48.335
it is truly a very

00:00:48.335 --> 00:00:50.518
>> very significant social issue that

00:00:50.518 --> 00:00:54.933
deserves attention, yes. I want to

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:57.576
share an experience with these young

00:00:57.576 --> 00:01:00.005
people: while your life certainly

00:01:00.005 --> 00:01:02.363
belongs to you, life is not just

00:01:02.363 --> 00:01:05.006
divided into stages; it is a journey

00:01:05.006 --> 00:01:07.364
spanning decades, perhaps even a

00:01:07.364 --> 00:01:14.829
century, from birth to passing. Mm. So,

00:01:14.829 --> 00:01:17.319
while you may have one perspective when

00:01:17.319 --> 00:01:19.497
you are young, your thoughts might

00:01:19.497 --> 00:01:23.699
change if you look at the long term.

00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:26.171
>> I also hope that everyone can have a

00:01:26.171 --> 00:01:28.709
wonderful, fulfilling life that meets

00:01:28.709 --> 00:01:30.879
their own needs.

00:01:30.879 --> 00:01:33.889
>> But as President, my hope is to create

00:01:33.889 --> 00:01:35.482
better conditions.

00:01:35.482 --> 00:01:38.827
>> Mm. Because if I encourage raising

00:01:38.827 --> 00:01:41.093
children, then I should build a better

00:01:41.093 --> 00:01:43.359
environment for raising them, allowing

00:01:43.359 --> 00:01:45.567
young people to feel willing and free

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:47.362
from worry to start families.

00:01:47.362 --> 00:01:49.718
>> That is why I mentioned the zero-to-18

00:01:49.718 --> 00:01:51.953
growth journey earlier; that is just

00:01:51.953 --> 00:01:54.224
one part of it. We recently released

00:01:54.224 --> 00:01:56.271
our national population strategy,

00:01:56.271 --> 00:01:58.619
specifically the family support section

00:01:58.619 --> 00:01:59.799
. Mm.

00:01:59.799 --> 00:02:02.929
>> Beyond the zero-to-18 growth journey,

00:02:02.929 --> 00:02:06.224
we are focusing on three stages: birth,

00:02:06.224 --> 00:02:09.660
raising, and education. We have

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.990
proposed childbirth subsidies. And for

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.416
affordable childcare, we are also

00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:19.382
providing educational subsidies. Then

00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:22.090
there is housing. Mm.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.618
>> And a friendly workplace.

00:02:24.618 --> 00:02:27.847
>> In other words, allowing young parents

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.205
>> to not have to choose between their

00:02:30.205 --> 00:02:33.026
family and their work. Of course, what

00:02:33.026 --> 00:02:35.881
I’m describing is a concept, but I am

00:02:35.881 --> 00:02:41.367
not a scholar. And I am not just an

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:43.848
elder; because I am the President, I

00:02:43.848 --> 00:02:46.262
have the responsibility to create a

00:02:46.262 --> 00:02:48.877
better environment so that young people

00:02:48.877 --> 00:02:52.877
...
